不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin037-near-007","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBCA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBC","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子據立","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_jin037_near_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p004","quote":"孝王略，字元簡，孝敬慈順，小心下士，少有父風。元康初，湣懷太子在東宮，選大臣子弟有名稱者以為賓友，略與華恆等並侍左右。曆散騎黃門侍郎、散騎常侍、秘書監，出為安南將軍、持節、都督沔南諸軍事，遷安北將軍、都督青州諸軍事。略逼青州刺史程牧，牧避之，略自領州。永興初，㡉令劉根起兵東萊，誑惑百姓，眾以萬數，攻略於臨淄，略不能距，走保聊城。懷帝即位，遷使持節、都督荊州諸軍事、征南大將軍、開府儀同三司。京兆流人王逌與叟人郝洛聚眾數千，屯于冠軍。略遣參軍崔曠率將軍皮初、張洛等討逌，為逌所譎，戰敗。略更遣左司馬曹攄統曠等進逼逌。將大戰，曠在後密自退走，攄軍無繼，戰敗，死之。略乃赦曠罪，復遣部將韓松又督曠攻逌，逌降。尋進開府，加散騎常侍。永嘉三年薨，追贈侍中、太尉，子據立。薨，無子，以彭城康王子紘為嗣。其後紘歸本宗，立紘子俊以奉其祀。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p004:m0328","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p004:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"本完整收到單元原詞與雙人物錨；不由列表補絕對排行或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin037-near-009","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADAAAB","predicate":"ritual_successor_of","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBCA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"以彭城康王子紘為嗣","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_jin037_near_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"succession_kind":"childless_named_successor","legal_adoption_status":"not_stated","parentage_inference":"not_inferr